# Angular does not read `.env` files. This example configures the SDK from
# `src/environments/environment.ts`, where every value is empty and falls back
# to the public Coras sandbox + CDN - so a fresh clone runs with no setup.
#
# To point at a different backend, edit `src/environments/environment.ts`:
#
#   apiHost        Coras API origin        (default: https://sandbox.coras.io)
#   distributorId  Distributor id          (default: the shared example distributor)
#   assetsUrl      SDK shared-asset base   (default: https://assets.sandbox.coras.io/shared)
#
# This file is documentation only; it is not loaded at runtime.
